<h2 style="margin: 0; font-weight: 400; font-size: clamp(40px, 4.6vw, 68px); line-height: .98; letter-spacing: -0.04em">Forward-deployed<br>materials engineering.</h2>
</div>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.5; color: #3E4143; max-width: 460px">We embed with U.S. agencies and OEM innovation teams, engineer the material to their spec, and scale it with partner-funded production. The same path took Gorilla Glass from Corning’s lab into billions of devices.</p>
</div>
